                "caption": "Figure 1:(Left)Selected samples from UNIFIEDon ImageNet-1K256×256256\\times 256(CFG scale4.04.0).(Right)Full unification is not merely feasible but beneficial.gFID (↓\\downarrow) at three sizes; bar labels give the total trainable parameters. UNIFIED improves on UNITE at every size, and Tiny UNIFIED nearly matches Small UNITE with about half the parameters (2.782.78at6262M vs.2.762.76at117117M). Separate is a standard three-network pipeline (Figure2a), trained at Small and Base. UNITE and UNIFIED: mean over five evaluation seeds (Table14).",
